  "title": "Pomegranate Stew with Chicken (Khoresh Fesenjan)",
  "description": "Not your everyday chicken dish! In this unique preparation, chicken legs and onions are sauteed in olive oil, then slow simmered with pomegranate juice, pureed toasted walnuts, and cardamom.",
